  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "With E Xuan Ming and Wei Xin he greets Dong Fang alliance leader Dong Fang Yu Liang when the three are called to discuss how to deal with Wolf King Chang Shan Yin. Among enslavement Gu Masters in that alliance army, the text ranks these three as the most outstanding.",
      "chapters": [
        506
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_e_xuan_ming",
        "char_wan_xin",
        "fac_dong_fang_alliance",
        "char_dong_fang_yu_liang",
        "char_chang_shan_yin",
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Jiang Wan Shan states he was not an enslavement path Gu Master from the start. On an expedition he found Blood Sea Ancestor’s small inheritance and obtained bladewing blood bats, then spent years gathering related enslavement path Gu with slow progress.",
      "chapters": [
        506
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master",
        "char_blood_sea_ancestor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Dong Fang Yu Liang sends E Xuan Ming, Wei Xin, and Jiang Wan Shan onto the field at the chosen moment.",
      "chapters": [
        510
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "combined-defense-against-wolves",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The three activate three hearts combination soul, merge souls, and speak in sync while crabs and crocodiles hold a defensive line against the wolf charge. Fang Yuan names the aerial bladewing blood bats as Jiang Wan Shan’s group when those bats cut into the wolves and let the mixed crab and crocodile force push forward.",
      "chapters": [
        511
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "combined-defense-against-wolves",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hei Lou Lan’s improved dark vortex kills Wei Xin, Jiang Wan Shan, and E Xuan Ming while they are still in three hearts combination soul state, and the mixed beast group then turns on itself without guidance. Dong Fang Yu Liang had prepared a transfer escape for the three, but the improved move locks the surrounding space and that escape fails.",
      "chapters": [
        513
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_lou_lan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 506’s greeting line prints Jiang Wan Shang, then the same speaker’s next line and later battle chapters print Jiang Wan Shan.",
      "chapters": [
        506
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "translation-notes",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "One chapter 513 recall also prints Jiang Wang Shan for the same third member of that trio.",
      "chapters": [
        513
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "translation-notes",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "No Chinese characters for the personal name appear in the English chapter text used here.",
      "chapters": [],
